WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.110
Construction is one of the biggest users of energy and one of the biggest polluters.
建筑业是最大的能源消耗者之一，也是最大的污染源之一。

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:13.120
According to AI Magazine, construction is responsible for using 38% of world energy.
据《人工智能杂志》报道，建筑业消耗了全球38%的能源。

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:21.340
The building part alone accounts for almost 55% of electricity use and 33% of greenhouse gases.
单是建筑物这一部分，就占了用电量的近55%、温室气体排放量的33%。

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:27.360
It’s also well known that steel produces too much material waste in building construction.
大家也都知道，在建筑施工中，钢材会造成过多的材料浪费。

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.130
Because of this big challenge, the future of sustainable construction may lie with AI.
由于这一巨大挑战，可持续建筑的未来可能在于人工智能。

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:41.930
AI is able to study building efficiency performance by grouping data to find the best chances for sustainable material usage.
人工智能能够通过将数据分组来研究建筑的效率表现，找出可持续使用材料的最佳机会。

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:48.930
With a tool like AI, the future of sustainable construction could progress much faster than in the past.
有了人工智能这样的工具，可持续建筑在未来可能会比过去发展得快得多。

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:57.540
Besides, AI helps architects work with new tools and sustainable materials to create better buildings and cities of the future.
此外，人工智能还帮助建筑师运用新工具和可持续材料，打造更好的未来建筑和城市。

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:09.110
For example, construction 3D printing guided by AI can offer better choices for building materials to save money, and map out how construction materials could be recycled.
例如，人工智能指导下的建筑3D打印能提供更好的建筑材料选择以节省资金，还能规划出建筑材料可以怎样回收利用。

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:19.150
In a professional article, AI is praised as a tool for sustainable construction: “In recent years, AI has become a promising tool for construction.
一篇专业文章称赞人工智能是可持续建筑的工具：“近年来，人工智能已成为建筑业一种有前景的工具。

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:30.090
AI can examine a large number of data sets on weather conditions and help to make full use of building systems for energy efficiency, water protection and other goals.”
人工智能可以仔细研究大量有关天气状况的数据集，并帮助充分利用建筑系统，以达到提高能源效率、保护水资源等目标。”

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:39.330
AI can be used to speed up the future of sustainable construction, set standards for the industry, and make construction more efficient and affordable.
人工智能可以用来加快可持续建筑的未来发展，为这个行业制定标准，并让建筑施工更高效、更实惠。

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:50.800
Like any other computer program, AI is a tool that is particularly good at studying data sets, but for the moment it still requires smart and ethical human beings to lead its work.
和其他任何计算机程序一样，人工智能是一种特别擅长研究数据集的工具，但目前仍需要聪明且有道德的人来主导它的工作。

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:56.450
All of that has to be done with respect for humans, so it’s really up to us to make it work.
这一切都必须以尊重人类为前提，所以要让它发挥作用，真的得靠我们自己。
